{
  "name": "Send Stripe PDF Invoices and Recover Failed Payments on WhatsApp with Google Sheets and Supergreen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a6060006-6666-4666-8666-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 920,
        "content": "## Stripe PDF Invoice Delivery & Failed-Payment Dunning on WhatsApp\n\n### Who this is for\nSubscription businesses, agencies, and SaaS founders using Stripe who lose revenue to unread dunning emails and want automatic WhatsApp PDF receipts on paid invoices plus interactive WhatsApp recovery polls when cards fail.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Flow A — Stripe Invoice Paid / Failed Router:**\n   - **Stripe Trigger** listens for `invoice.payment_succeeded` and `invoice.payment_failed`.\n   - Extracts the customer's WhatsApp phone from Stripe (`customer_phone` or `metadata.whatsapp`), invoice number, amount, `invoice_pdf`, and `hosted_invoice_url`.\n   - **Paid Invoices:** Downloads the official Stripe PDF into binary `data`, sends the named PDF receipt over WhatsApp via **Supergreen**, and logs `Paid` in your **Google Sheets** billing ledger.\n   - **Failed Invoices:** Logs `Past Due` in Google Sheets, sends the customer their Stripe `hosted_invoice_url` payment link on WhatsApp, and follows up with an interactive WhatsApp Poll (`Updated payment method`, `Retry in 3 days`, `Need billing help`).\n2. **Flow B — Dunning Poll Vote Handler:**\n   - **Supergreen Trigger** (`events: ['vote']`) captures the customer's poll response in real time, updates their recovery status in **Google Sheets**, confirms receipt on WhatsApp, and alerts your finance WhatsApp group whenever a customer selects `Need billing help`.\n\n### Community Node & Compatibility\n- **Community node:** `n8n-nodes-supergreen` (tested `v0.1.5` on n8n `v1.76+`) — **verified community node** available directly on **n8n Cloud** and self-hosted n8n (`https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-supergreen`).\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect **Stripe API**, **Supergreen API** (`https://supergreen.cc`), and **Google Sheets OAuth2** credentials.\n2. Create a Google Sheet tab named `Invoices` with columns: `invoiceId`, `invoiceNumber`, `phone`, `customerName`, `amount`, `status`, `recoveryNote`, `updatedAt`.\n3. Ensure your Stripe customers store a phone number (`phone` field or `metadata.whatsapp`).\n4. Update **Configure Billing Settings** and **Configure Recovery Settings** (`companyName`, `spreadsheetId`, `financeGroupChatId`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a6060006-6666-4666-8666-000000000002",
      "name": "Stripe Flow Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1700,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow A: Stripe Invoice Paid (PDF Receipt) vs. Failed (Dunning Link + Poll)\n\nRoutes paid invoices to binary PDF download + WhatsApp document delivery, and routes failed renewals to instant WhatsApp recovery links + interactive status polls while logging both to Google Sheets."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a6060006-6666-4666-8666-000000000003",
      "name": "Dunning Vote Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1700,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow B: Real-Time Dunning Poll Response & Finance Escalation\n\nUpdates the Google Sheets `Invoices` ledger when a past-due customer votes on the recovery poll and alerts the finance team's WhatsApp group if they need human billing assistance."
      }
    },
